<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Kerry Group 1996 pre-tax profits up 19 pct.</title>
<headline>Kerry Group 1996 pre-tax profits up 19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr(p), after goodwill 26.9		   vs 23.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.56		   vs 2.23</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 3.83		   vs 3.33</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    51.23		  vs 43.18</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,233.3		vs 1,199.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Kerry Group Plc is an Irish food company.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom + 353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
